title: TalkToLizdiniOne
tags:
---
LIZDINI: Bubbles! Where are you going? Wait—I am the mighty wizard Lizdini, and I command... uhh, what was I commanding again?
-> MY TADPOLES WERE CAPTURED!
BUBBLES: MY TADPOLES WERE TAKEN!!
LIZDINI: WHAT?! Tadpoles? Did they like... turn into big scary... fish things? Or are we talking about... the little ones that wiggle? Either way, NO WORRIES! I'm a wizard! I got this!
LIZDINI: I’ve mastered the art of... magical... confusion. Watch! I’ll zap them with my wand!
-> Who’s We? We’re speaking in French?
BUBBLES: No, you're staying here. It's too risky for you.
LIZDINI: Risky?! Please, Bubbles, I’m basically a pro wizard.
LIZDINI: You'll need me, I can cast the most powerful spell ever, guaranteed to help! 
LIZDINI: Shazamflippo... hexapoppo!
Nothing happens.
LIZDINI: Uh, right, that one usually summons... uh, a pizza. Oops.
-> Just budge and let him.
BUBBLES: Fine, alright. I do need all of the help I can get.
LIZDINI: YES! I knew you’d see my magical greatness!
-> Ask about the water.
BUBBLES: Hey, what’s this water over here? It’s not poisoned, right?
LIZDINI: Poisoned? No way, that’s like... totally NOT a thing.
BUBBLES: Alright, thanks!
LIZDINI: No problem! Just remember, if you need a magic fix, I’m your guy. I’m basically one spell away from being a master wizard. (And by "master," I mean “super close but still don’t know what half of my spells do.”)
LIZDINI: I'll be right behind you! 
LIZDINI: Wait... I can't move!
LIZDINI: My creators haven't created a script for that yet! Just pretend I'm always there..
BUBBLES: Uh-huh...
===
